    <sys:String x:Key="Editor.ExpectHint">轮到这一步时游戏应该是什么样子。EndHud 会找到与当前画面最吻合的步骤，条件全部满足时这一步会亮起。技能本身就绪不需要添加。</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Editor.AddCondition">添加条件</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Editor.RemoveCondition">删除条件</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Editor.Condition.SkillPoints">技力</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Editor.Condition.Combo">连携技</sys:String>
